# Personal dev notes — not for publishing, see DEV_NOTES.md.
DEV_NOTES.md

# Scratch space for testing `create` / `pre_launch_task` against a local
# `dart pub global activate --source path .` checkout (see DEV_NOTES.md).
# Never run those commands at the repo root — see the warning there for why.
# Anchored to the repo root only — a bare `test/` also matches source/test/
# and example/test/, which are real, tracked, and must ship in the package
# (dart pub publish flags a tracked-but-gitignored file as a potential
# publish-time exclusion, which would silently drop those test suites).
/test/